2026-05-28 11:25:35,423 | DEBUG | anthropic._base_client | Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-90724760-f552-4508-8691-7caaf44670df', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 8192, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Requirement (natural language):\nImplement a producer-consumer system with three components:\n\n  1. A bounded FIFO queue of capacity 3. Items are positive integers in\n     1..10. Enqueue is rejected when the queue is full; dequeue is rejected\n     when the queue is empty.\n  2. A producer that generates items 1..3 in order and enqueues them.\n  3. A consumer that dequeues items and tracks the running sum.\n\nSafety properties:\n  - The queue length is always in 0..3.\n  - No item is ever lost: every item produced is eventually consumed in\n    FIFO order (i.e. consumer.received is a prefix of producer.generated).\n  - The producer never produces beyond item 3.\n\nApproved decomposition plan:\nParent: ProducerConsumerSystem\nParent role: Composes the bounded FIFO queue with a producer and consumer, wiring enqueue/dequeue actions and asserting global safety: bounded queue length, FIFO no-loss between producer.generated and consumer.received, and producer bound.\n\nChild modules:\n  - BoundedQueue: Bounded FIFO queue of capacity 3 holding integers in 1..10; rejects enqueue when full and dequeue when empty.\n      state_variables: buffer\n      actions: Enqueue, Dequeue\n      invariant_sketch: buffer length stays in 0..3 and every element is an integer in 1..10; FIFO order is preserved across enqueue/dequeue.\n  - Producer: Generates items 1, 2, 3 in order and offers them to the queue; stops after item 3.\n      state_variables: generated, nextItem\n      actions: Produce\n      invariant_sketch: generated is a prefix of <<1,2,3>> and nextItem never exceeds 4.\n  - Consumer: Dequeues items from the queue, appends them to its received log, and accumulates a running sum.\n      state_variables: received, sum\n      actions: Consume\n      invariant_sketch: sum equals the arithmetic sum of received, and received only grows by appending dequeued items in FIFO order.\n\nExpand this plan into a ModuleBundle. For each child, emit both <Name>_Abs (pure TLA+) and <Name>_Impl (PlusCal-bearing TLA+). Emit a parent module that INSTANCEs each impl and defines its own composed Inv and Property. Pin small finite CONSTANTS so TLC can model-check exhaustively. Emit one call to propose_module_bundle.'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RGqGCqzyUHzcLhaVT3NMhZ', 'name': 'propose_module_bundle', 'input': {'slug': 'producer_consumer_system', 'parent': {'name': 'ProducerConsumerSystem', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE ProducerConsumerSystem ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nVARIABLES buffer, generated, nextItem, received, sum\n\nQ == INSTANCE BoundedQueue_Impl WITH buffer <- buffer\nP == INSTANCE Producer_Impl WITH generated <- generated, nextItem <- nextItem\nC == INSTANCE Consumer_Impl WITH received <- received, sum <- sum\n\nvars == <<buffer, generated, nextItem, received, sum>>\n\nSumSeq[s \\in Seq(1..10)] ==\n  IF s = <<>> THEN 0 ELSE Head(s) + SumSeq[Tail(s)]\n\nIsPrefix(a, b) ==\n  /\\ Len(a) <= Len(b)\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(a) : a[i] = b[i]\n\nInit ==\n  /\\ buffer = <<>>\n  /\\ generated = <<>>\n  /\\ nextItem = 1\n  /\\ received = <<>>\n  /\\ sum = 0\n\nProduceStep ==\n  /\\ nextItem <= 3\n  /\\ Len(buffer) < 3\n  /\\ buffer' = Append(buffer, nextItem)\n  /\\ generated' = Append(generated, nextItem)\n  /\\ nextItem' = nextItem + 1\n  /\\ UNCHANGED <<received, sum>>\n\nConsumeStep ==\n  /\\ Len(buffer) > 0\n  /\\ received' = Append(received, Head(buffer))\n  /\\ sum' = sum + Head(buffer)\n  /\\ buffer' = Tail(buffer)\n  /\\ UNCHANGED <<generated, nextItem>>\n\nNext == ProduceStep \\/ ConsumeStep\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ buffer \\in Seq(1..10)\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..3\n  /\\ nextItem \\in 1..4\n  /\\ generated \\in Seq(1..10)\n  /\\ received \\in Seq(1..10)\n  /\\ Len(generated) = nextItem - 1\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(generated) : generated[i] = i\n  /\\ IsPrefix(received, generated)\n  /\\ generated = received \\o buffer\n  /\\ sum = SumSeq[received]\n\nProperty ==\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..3\n  /\\ IsPrefix(received, generated)\n  /\\ nextItem <= 4\n====\n"}, 'modules': [{'name': 'BoundedQueue', 'role': 'abs', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE BoundedQueue_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS Capacity, MaxVal\n\nVARIABLES queue\n\nvars == <<queue>>\n\nInit == queue = <<>>\n\nEnqueue(v) ==\n  /\\ v \\in 1..MaxVal\n  /\\ Len(queue) < Capacity\n  /\\ queue' = Append(queue, v)\n\nDequeue ==\n  /\\ Len(queue) > 0\n  /\\ queue' = Tail(queue)\n\nNext == (\\E v \\in 1..MaxVal : Enqueue(v)) \\/ Dequeue\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ queue \\in Seq(1..MaxVal)\n  /\\ Len(queue) \\in 0..Capacity\n\nProperty == Len(queue) \\in 0..Capacity\n====\n"}, {'name': 'BoundedQueue', 'role': 'impl', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'abstraction_map': {'queue': 'buffer'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE BoundedQueue_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS Capacity, MaxVal\n\n(* --algorithm BoundedQueue\nvariables buffer = <<>>;\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with v \\in 1..MaxVal do\n          if Len(buffer) < Capacity then\n            buffer := Append(buffer, v);\n          end if;\n        end with;\n      or\n        if Len(buffer) > 0 then\n          buffer := Tail(buffer);\n        end if;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ buffer \\in Seq(1..MaxVal)\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n  /\\ pc = "Loop"\n\nProperty == Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n====\n', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE BoundedQueue_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS Capacity, MaxVal\n\n(* --algorithm BoundedQueue\nvariables buffer = <<>>;\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with v \\in 1..MaxVal do\n          if Len(buffer) < Capacity then\n            buffer := Append(buffer, v);\n          end if;\n        end with;\n      or\n        if Len(buffer) > 0 then\n          buffer := Tail(buffer);\n        end if;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ buffer \\in Seq(1..MaxVal)\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n  /\\ pc = "Loop"\n\nProperty == Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n====\n', 'constants': {'values': {'Capacity': [3], 'MaxVal': [10]}}}, {'name': 'Producer', 'role': 'abs', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE Producer_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS MaxItem\n\nVARIABLES generated, nextItem\n\nvars == <<generated, nextItem>>\n\nExpected == [i \\in 1..MaxItem |-> i]\n\nInit ==\n  /\\ generated = <<>>\n  /\\ nextItem = 1\n\nProduce ==\n  /\\ nextItem <= MaxItem\n  /\\ generated' = Append(generated, nextItem)\n  /\\ nextItem' = nextItem + 1\n\nNext == Produce\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ nextItem \\in 1..(MaxItem+1)\n  /\\ generated \\in Seq(1..MaxItem)\n  /\\ Len(generated) = nextItem - 1\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(generated) : generated[i] = i\n\nProperty == nextItem <= MaxItem + 1\n====\n"}, {'name': 'Producer', 'role': 'impl', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'abstraction_map': {'generated': 'generated', 'nextItem': 'nextItem'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE Producer_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS MaxItem\n\n(* --algorithm Producer\nvariables generated = <<>>, nextItem = 1;\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while nextItem <= MaxItem do\n      generated := Append(generated, nextItem);\n      nextItem := nextItem + 1;\n    end while;\n  Finish:\n    skip;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ nextItem \\in 1..(MaxItem+1)\n  /\\ generated \\in Seq(1..MaxItem)\n  /\\ Len(generated) = nextItem - 1\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(generated) : generated[i] = i\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop", "Finish", "Done"}\n  /\\ (pc \\in {"Finish", "Done"}) => (nextItem > MaxItem)\n\nProperty == nextItem <= MaxItem + 1\n====\n', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE Producer_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS MaxItem\n\n(* --algorithm Producer\nvariables generated = <<>>, nextItem = 1;\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while nextItem <= MaxItem do\n      generated := Append(generated, nextItem);\n      nextItem := nextItem + 1;\n    end while;\n  Finish:\n    skip;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ nextItem \\in 1..(MaxItem+1)\n  /\\ generated \\in Seq(1..MaxItem)\n  /\\ Len(generated) = nextItem - 1\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(generated) : generated[i] = i\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop", "Finish", "Done"}\n  /\\ (pc \\in {"Finish", "Done"}) => (nextItem > MaxItem)\n\nProperty == nextItem <= MaxItem + 1\n====\n', 'constants': {'values': {'MaxItem': [3]}}}, {'name': 'Consumer', 'role': 'abs', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE Consumer_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS MaxVal\n\nVARIABLES received, sum\n\nvars == <<received, sum>>\n\nSumSeq[s \\in Seq(1..MaxVal)] ==\n  IF s = <<>> THEN 0 ELSE Head(s) + SumSeq[Tail(s)]\n\nInit ==\n  /\\ received = <<>>\n  /\\ sum = 0\n\nConsume(v) ==\n  /\\ v \\in 1..MaxVal\n  /\\ received' = Append(received, v)\n  /\\ sum' = sum + v\n\nNext == \\E v \\in 1..MaxVal : Consume(v)\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ received \\in Seq(1..MaxVal)\n  /\\ sum = SumSeq[received]\n\nProperty == sum = SumSeq[received]\n====\n"}, {'name': 'Consumer', 'role': 'impl', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'abstraction_map': {'received': 'received', 'sum': 'sum'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE Consumer_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTA