erts code that may conflict. Let me move helpers and avoid `RECURSIVE` syntax. I'll inline-define SumSeq using a CHOOSE / a function expression bounded by sequence length using Folds, but simpler: use `LET ... IN` with a recursive function defined via `[x \\in DOMAIN ... |-> ...]`. Actually the cleanest fix is using a `RECURSIVE` declaration on its own line (which I did) — the issue might be the IsSeqIn definition order. Let me also drop `Len(s) \\in 0..3` style checks etc. \\n\\nRewriting carefully: avoid IsSeqIn (it's unusual). Replace it with an explicit `\\A i \\in 1..Len(s) : s[i] \\in 1..MaxVal`. And for SumSeq use a bounded recursive function: `SumOf(s) == LET RECURSIVE f(_) f(t) == IF t = <<>> THEN 0 ELSE Head(t)+f(Tail(t)) IN f(s)`. That LET-RECURSIVE form is well-supported. \\n\\nLet me also double-check: in TLA+, RECURSIVE needs to be at module level on its own line. Try splitting onto two separate logical units.", 'targeted_failure': 'all/parse', 'slug': 'producer_consumer_system', 'parent': {'name': 'ProducerConsumerSystem', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE ProducerConsumerSystem ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nVARIABLES buffer, generated, nextItem, received, sum\n\nQ == INSTANCE BoundedQueue_Impl WITH buffer <- buffer\nP == INSTANCE Producer_Impl WITH generated <- generated, nextItem <- nextItem\nC == INSTANCE Consumer_Impl WITH received <- received, sum <- sum\n\nvars == <<buffer, generated, nextItem, received, sum>>\n\nSumOf(s) ==\n  LET RECURSIVE f(_)\n      f(t) == IF t = <<>> THEN 0 ELSE Head(t) + f(Tail(t))\n  IN f(s)\n\nIsPrefix(a, b) ==\n  /\\ Len(a) <= Len(b)\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(a) : a[i] = b[i]\n\nInit ==\n  /\\ buffer = <<>>\n  /\\ generated = <<>>\n  /\\ nextItem = 1\n  /\\ received = <<>>\n  /\\ sum = 0\n\nProduceStep ==\n  /\\ nextItem <= 3\n  /\\ Len(buffer) < 3\n  /\\ buffer' = Append(buffer, nextItem)\n  /\\ generated' = Append(generated, nextItem)\n  /\\ nextItem' = nextItem + 1\n  /\\ UNCHANGED <<received, sum>>\n\nConsumeStep ==\n  /\\ Len(buffer) > 0\n  /\\ received' = Append(received, Head(buffer))\n  /\\ sum' = sum + Head(buffer)\n  /\\ buffer' = Tail(buffer)\n  /\\ UNCHANGED <<generated, nextItem>>\n\nNext == ProduceStep \\/ ConsumeStep\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..3\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(buffer) : buffer[i] \\in 1..10\n  /\\ nextItem \\in 1..4\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(generated) : generated[i] \\in 1..10\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(received) : received[i] \\in 1..10\n  /\\ Len(generated) = nextItem - 1\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(generated) : generated[i] = i\n  /\\ IsPrefix(received, generated)\n  /\\ generated = received \\o buffer\n  /\\ sum = SumOf(received)\n\nProperty ==\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..3\n  /\\ IsPrefix(received, generated)\n  /\\ nextItem <= 4\n====\n"}, 'modules': [{'name': 'BoundedQueue', 'role': 'abs', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE BoundedQueue_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS Capacity, MaxVal\n\nVARIABLES queue\n\nvars == <<queue>>\n\nInit == queue = <<>>\n\nEnqueue(v) ==\n  /\\ v \\in 1..MaxVal\n  /\\ Len(queue) < Capacity\n  /\\ queue' = Append(queue, v)\n\nDequeue ==\n  /\\ Len(queue) > 0\n  /\\ queue' = Tail(queue)\n\nNext == (\\E v \\in 1..MaxVal : Enqueue(v)) \\/ Dequeue\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ Len(queue) \\in 0..Capacity\n  /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(queue) : queue[i] \\in 1..MaxVal\n\nProperty == Len(queue) \\in 0..Capacity\n====\n"}, {'name': 'BoundedQueue', 'role': 'impl', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'abstraction_map': {'queue': 'buffer'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE BoundedQueue_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS Capacity, MaxVal\n\n(* --algorithm BoundedQueue\nvariables buffer = <<>>;\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with v \\in 1..MaxVal do\n          if Len(buffer) < Capacity then\n            buffer :